{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":503876,"name":"Daniel Brinkschröder","username":"Daniel_Brin","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:50:16.573Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503876-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503876-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503876-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503876-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy grok bot computer is unreachable for two days\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bot installed a free vpn client on the computer to hide its traffic. Since then the computer has been unreachable (two days already).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease remove the vpn from your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503876-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503876-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen desctop view, the computer is unreachable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503876-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503876-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe grok bot computer should be reachable. The bot should be sble to work normally.\u003cbr\u003e\nI tried retry, recover and reset.\u003cbr\u003e\nAll 3 failed.\u003cbr\u003e\nMy requests without a reply.\u003cbr\u003e\nPlease rebuild the computer from your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503876-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503876-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u00